title: Nom-NomIntro
position: -62,-133
---
Nom-Nom: Well, hellooo there, traveler! Aren't you a sorry sight? Meat hangin' off your bones...that, er, starved look in your eyes...
Nom-Nom: No need to eat me, now! Sit down here a moment and I'll whip up somethin' nice for ya.
// Cutscene here? Or something to indicate that Nom-Nom cooks food for you
-> Thank you.
  Nom-Nom: Think nothing of it! Mmm, the taste of zombie flesh just can't be beat, eh?
  Nom-Nom: Guess they haven't figured that out yet, or we wouldn't have to worry about ourselves.
  Nom-Nom: But maybe that means us normal folk taste even BETTER than zombies? To think that we'll never know...brings a tear to my eye... *sniff*
  -> Didn't you just tell me not to eat you?
    Nom-Nom: Har-har-har! Forgive me, I got distracted. Traveler, do ya know WHY the world is in this mess?
    -> No...
      Nom-Nom: Oh, bless your hungry little heart. Well, keep your head on and I'll tell ya a little story.
      // Add plot explanation/exposition, tutorial?
===

title: BibiBubuRescued
position: -62,-133
---
Bibi: Bubu, look up, there's someone here!
Bubu: Oh...death has arrived...how strangely sweet...
-> I'm not a zombie!
  Bubu: Oh- my bad. It's kind of hard to tell.
  Bibi: Hey, now that I think about it, you look kind of...tasty...
  -> ...Um?????
    Bibi: JUST KIDDING~!!! Did I scare you? Hahahahahaha!!
    Bubu: ...
    -> Are you guys okay?
      Bubu: Physically, our health is pristine. But perhaps that is the only thing untouched by these hardships...
      Bibi: Oh, don't be so dramatic, silly! We are both TOTALLY!!! FINE!!! As long as we keeeeeep smiling~
      Bubu: We have been sleeping in a ditch for the past five days.
      -> Well, about that...
        Bibi: So, so you're telling me, I FINALLY have a CUSTOMER for my HAPPY GADGETS?!??!
        Bubu: (Please don't call them that.) A roof over our heads again...does sound rather preferable. Thank you.
===


